  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that for multiprofile settings, aggregation methods (avgpool vs transformer) significantly impact accuracy (config_005: 0.5176 vs config_020: 0.5070). This experiment tests whether changing fusion method from concat (used in config_005) to weighted, while keeping image encoder (imagenet_vit_l), aggregation (avgpool), and profile setting (multiprofile) constant, could improve performance. This isolates the effect of fusion strategy in a high-performing multiprofile configuration, addressing uncertainty about whether weighted fusion might outperform concat in this context."
